OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pay tribute to 'kind and
OL,4,Acaring' woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 73-year-old woman who died after
OL,7,Fbeing found with serious injuries has
OL,8,Fbeen described by her family as "kind
OL,9,Fand caring".
OL,11,FElizabeth Hardy, from Henlow in
OL,12,FBedfordshire, was found by
OL,13,FHertfordshire Police officers at an
OL,14,Faddress in Armour Rise, Hitchin, on 6
OL,15,FOctober, and was pronounced dead at the
OL,16,Fscene.
OL,18,FPolice said her relative Douglas Hardy,
OL,19,F59, who lives in the street, was
OL,20,Fcharged with murder and his trial was
OL,21,Fdue to start at St Albans Crown Court
OL,22,Fon 15 March.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
